    <string name="sec_beta_notes">BETA RELEASE NOTES</string>
    <string name="beta_notes_badge">BETA</string>
    <string name="beta_notes_title">What is new in 3.5.0 (Beta)</string>
    <string name="beta_notes_body">An experimental release. Some things may still be unstable - please bear with us and help report anything odd.</string>
    <string name="beta_note_1">- Backup streaming path (fallback) direct to YouTube when the main extractor fails - songs and search keep working.</string>
    <string name="beta_note_2">- Sharper artist channel thumbnails on Home and the player page.</string>
    <string name="beta_note_3">- The queue is extended earlier and more smoothly (non-stop radio).</string>
    <string name="beta_note_4">- Permission cleanup and signing preparation for a cleaner install.</string>
    <string name="beta_note_5">- Search, playlists and streams use the InnerTube fallback when the main extractor is disrupted.</string>
